.\n\nAs a gay, #MeToo\u00a0 woman of color, Trump assaults my entire being.","media":null,"username":"Mattison","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":65,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":72,"sumOfClimate":19,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"998157538699956224","date":1526814276000,"rawContent":"#MeToo We need to shut this down. Time to revisit and revise the Violence against Women Act: Threaten or commit domestic violence or harassment, lose your weapons and loose right to access weapons of any kind.. https:\/\/t.co\/3c0L34SDr0","media":null,"username":"Mattison","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":65,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":73,"sumOfClimate":19,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"999262439375073281","date":1527077705000,"rawContent":"@RVAwonk @realDonaldTrump It\u2019s what we have to do. As a #MeToo, gay woman of color with a German immigrant mother and African-American father, Trump assaults every fiber of my being. Silence is not an option. \n\nAnd thank you. Good to know and feel that you\u2019re they\u2019re relentlessly resisting through truth.","media":null,"username":"Mattison","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":65,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":74,"sumOfClimate":19,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"999724128511909888","date":1527187780000,"rawContent":"@RonanFarrow To be abused\/assaulted 